<h1>08 - Google login</h1>

<p>
    The Identity app from tutorial 05, plus <b>Log in with Google</b>. Google tells us who you are;
    the first time, we create a local user and link it to your Google account.
    After that it's a normal Identity login - same cookie, same claims, same policies.
</p>

<p>Local accounts still work: <b>user</b> / <b>user</b> and <b>admin</b> / <b>admin</b>.</p>
